      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我希望像之前看超级喷火驼那样，\n再看看超级进化后的宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE562115E0C671B50CF4E4B524D770B8D857EA755B7706B9A7C90A36837FF0C000A518D770B770B8D857EA78FDB5316540E76845B9D53EF68A6300200100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说到彩色隐形眼镜，当然就会想到眼睛！\n我很在意拥有大眼睛的宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n然后说到大眼睛，当然就会想到……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF452305F69827296905F62773C955CFF0C5F5371365C314F1A60F35230773C775BFF01000A62115F885728610F62E567095927773C775B76845B9D53EF68A6300200100001BE00000A7136540E8BF452305927773C775BFF0C5F5371365C314F1A60F352302026202600100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "勾魂眼！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52FE9B42773CFF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我尤其想看超级勾魂眼的眼睛！\n希望自己也能从中得到一些灵感！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115C24517660F3770B8D857EA752FE9B42773C7684773C775BFF01000A5E0C671B81EA5DF14E5F80FD4ECE4E2D5F9752304E004E9B7075611FFF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因此想拜托你！跟我来一场对战，\n让我看看超级勾魂眼吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E06B6460F362DC62584F60FF018DDF621167654E00573A5BF96218FF0C000A8BA96211770B770B8D857EA752FE9B42773C5427FF0100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "顺带一提，勾魂眼的超级石\n能够在阔星公司换到哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "987A5E264E0063D0FF0C52FE9B42773C76848D857EA777F3000A80FD591F57289614661F516C53F86362523054E6300200100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
